{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Dark Soul Chronicles: Immortal Slayer&quot; is a hack-and-slash ARPG game where you collect ancient divine weapons, magical armor, and rare treasures hidden deep within lost treasure troves. Whether you enhance your cultivation, refine golden elixirs, or slay demons... the path to immortality is entirely in your hands. There are countless paths to the Dao, all leading to the same destination. Whether you are an immortal, a demon, or a monster, you can achieve the supreme Dao, cultivate an immortal body, and let your soul roam freely between heaven and earth.</strong>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Pure cultivation experience + dark loot-hunting gameplay\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combining the exhilarating experience of flying on a sword with authentic dark fantasy loot-hunting gameplay,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break through your cultivation level, withstand tribulations, and prove your destiny is in your own hands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/9c7d2352cdef8284846f8b4a5790a3ee.poster.avif?t=1769500666\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/9c7d2352cdef8284846f8b4a5790a3ee.webm?t=1769500666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/9c7d2352cdef8284846f8b4a5790a3ee.mp4?t=1769500666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010A unique &quot;Five Elements Mutual Generation&quot; profession - Spiritual Cultivation\u3011</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique &quot;Five Elements Mutual Generation&quot; mechanism, fully automatically triggered, with extremely high stat caps, perfectly combining cultivation and treasure hunting, creating a treasure hunting profession with Chinese characteristics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/9a399da63c58027253cdcfae2c9bd037.poster.avif?t=1769500666\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/9a399da63c58027253cdcfae2c9bd037.webm?t=1769500666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/9a399da63c58027253cdcfae2c9bd037.mp4?t=1769500666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Unlimited Attribute Development - Nine Dragons Plate\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More comprehensive attribute growth, more diverse skill bonuses, all in--Nine Dragons Plate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/7aa2b0ea8013e6d018f07345ca28ff9c.poster.avif?t=1769500666\" width=926 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/7aa2b0ea8013e6d018f07345ca28ff9c.webm?t=1769500666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/7aa2b0ea8013e6d018f07345ca28ff9c.mp4?t=1769500666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010The Wisdom of Cultivation - The Cave Heaven of the Four Divine Beasts\u3011</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activating different of the Four Divine Beasts and creating the optimal attribute boosting strategy within a limited number of slots\u2014the Cave Heaven is the most intelligent way to adjust character builds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731940/extras/5f2fe4c31435416bf48e09682909302a.avif?t=1769500666\" width=925 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Rich gameplay + collection and achievements\u3011 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through various treasure-hunting gameplay modes such as Blood Moon Illusion, Gluttonous Altar, Asura Dungeon, Cursed Dragon Spring, and Nine Dragons Coil,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>defeat dozens of different monsters to collect materials and hunt bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>write your own immortal cultivation journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel free to leave a message in the community and discuss gameplay.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Foundation Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731940/e8609fd48aafa6f1847e4b670f4076d1f091e765.jpg"},{"name":"\u200cFull Superior Gear\u200c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731940/69a99e2d3d4ef3e5b0f0c71e6825091ee5b6ff82.jpg"},{"name":"\u200cFull Elite Gear\u200c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731940/604f78eded82f304a2eb636cbb02c154bcf8574c.jpg"},{"name":"\u200cFull Immortal Gear\u200c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731940/f8675beee2fa2b2747df66f955acd8ba8a1700f3.jpg"},{"name":"\u200cSteady Accumulation\u200c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731940/5bdd0e9f6c42a8ce5afe23124739ffa067157808.jpg"},{"name":"\u200cRegional Magnate\u200c","path":"https://